Origin
------

Written by Ledo Enterprises LLC for Measurement Instruments (the DuroPC
industrial-computer store), whose requirements shaped it: invoice-based selling,
charge-on-ship rather than charge-at-checkout, commercial and purchasing cards,
and ACH as the preferred settlement method.

